sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Visitor
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>RatingsSection
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>ViewDesignerRatingsBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>ViewDesignerRatingsController
  participant Rating as «entity»<br/>Rating
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: see a designer's average rating and reviews
  UI->>B: GET /api/designers/{id}/ratings (JWT)
  B->>C: view(Integer designerId, Integer projectId, Integer callerId, Pageable pageable)
  C->>Rating: summaryFor()
  Rating->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Rating: rows
  Rating-->>C: result
  C->>Rating: findForDesigner()
  Rating->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Rating: rows
  Rating-->>C: result
  C-->>B: DesignerRatingsResponse
  B-->>UI: 200 OK JSON
  UI-->>A: show result